{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Flappy Coq \u2013 The 2D Rooster Simulator Game</strong> is a fast-paced, funny, and fiendishly difficult arcade challenge with real stakes. Flap your way to the top of the global leaderboard \u2014 because this isn\u2019t just about bragging rights. It\u2019s a tournament.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every year, the <strong>Top 10 players worldwide win the prize pool</strong>, seeded at <strong>$1,000</strong> and growing with <strong>10% of all game sales</strong>. Your skill (and your rooster\u2019s wings) could literally pay off.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It\u2019s more than a flappy clone \u2014 it\u2019s a meme-fueled, rage-inducing, prize-chasing comedy wrapped in bright 2D visuals. Whether you\u2019re aiming for the leaderboard or just trying to survive another pipe, <i>Flappy Coq</i> will keep you coming back for \u201cjust one more run.\u201d</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc13 <strong>Simple Controls, Brutal Challenge</strong> \u2013 One button. Infinite ways to fail.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfc6 <strong>Global Tournament Mode</strong> \u2013 High scores are synced across all platforms, with yearly prize pools and real winners.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcb0 <strong>Prize Pool Backed by Sales</strong> \u2013 10% of every copy sold fuels the prize pool, starting at $1,000.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfaf <strong>Precision Gameplay</strong> \u2013 Every flap matters; every mistake is your fault.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\ude02 <strong>Dark Humor &amp; Crude Comedy</strong> \u2013 Yes, the rooster roots hens. Yes, it\u2019s ridiculous.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf0d <strong>Cross-Platform Leaderboards</strong> \u2013 Compete with players everywhere, anytime.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfa8 <strong>Cartoon 2D Visuals</strong> \u2013 Bright, colorful, and absurd.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfae <strong>Controller &amp; Keyboard Support</strong> \u2013 Play how you like, from couch to desk.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd25 <strong>Score Attack Mode</strong> \u2013 The only goal is survival, domination, and prizes.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Flap. Fail. Laugh. Compete. Win.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4068580?t=1759455715","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4068580/e414d4e7617572edf7148cf2dec0444fd8176d83/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1759455715","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4068580/3236c06fcb02ea04f6b4ba34f6eeab88718c8b29/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759455715","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4068580/3236c06fcb02ea04f6b4ba34f6eeab88718c8b29/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759455715","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[1,5],"notes":"This game contains crude humor and suggestive animal antics. Roosters may \u201ccourt\u201d hens in a comical, non-graphic way, accompanied by silly sound effects. There is no nudity, gore, or explicit sexual content."},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Flappy Coq \u2013 The 2D Rooster Simulator Game</strong> is a fast-paced, funny, and fiendishly difficult arcade challenge with real stakes. Flap your way to the top of the global leaderboard \u2014 because this isn\u2019t just about bragging rights. It\u2019s a tournament.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every year, the <strong>Top 10 players worldwide win the prize pool</strong>, seeded at <strong>$1,000</strong> and growing with <strong>10% of all game sales</strong>. Y